		Section Odeix__
			Section feast //HH0000
				when-movable-cycle-day-is
					78 use:
					95 use:
					110 use:
						Insert_section CAv.ode9.pe1.ti_h1234tas0VVVTh End-Insert
					120 use:
						Insert_section CAv.ode9.pe1.ti_hh12as00VV End-Insert
					otherwise use:
						when-date-is
							Jan 6 use:
								Insert_section CAv.ode9.me1.ti_h123asM1M2M3M4 End-Insert
							Feb 2 use:
